the upper 50s to lower 70s. West winds 5 to 10 mph...becoming

east after midnight. 

.SUNDAY...Sunny. Areas of smoke. Highs in the 80s to 90s. East

winds 5 to 10 mph...becoming southwest 10 to 15 mph in the

afternoon. 

.SUNDAY NIGHT...Clear. Areas of smoke in the evening. Lows in the

upper 50s to mid 70s. Northwest winds 10 to 15 mph. 

.MONDAY...Sunny. Highs in the lower 80s to mid 90s. Northwest

winds 5 to 15 mph. 

.MONDAY NIGHT...Clear. Lows in the upper 50s to lower 70s.

Northwest winds 10 to 20 mph. 

.TUESDAY...Sunny. Highs in the lower 80s to mid 90s. 

.TUESDAY NIGHT THROUGH THURSDAY...Mostly clear. Lows in the 50s

to 60s. Highs in the mid 70s to lower 90s. 

.THURSDAY NIGHT AND FRIDAY...Clear. Lows in the lower 50s to mid

60s. Highs in the lower 70s to mid 80s. 

.FRIDAY NIGHT AND SATURDAY...Mostly clear. Lows in the 50s to

lower 60s. Highs in the upper 60s to lower 80s. 





