634 PM EDT Mon Aug 11 2025



.TONIGHT...Mostly cloudy with a chance of showers. A chance of

thunderstorms, mainly this evening. Patchy fog after midnight.

Lows in the lower 70s. East winds 5 to 10 mph. Chance of rain

50 percent. 

.TUESDAY...Patchy fog in the morning. Mostly cloudy with a chance

of thunderstorms. A chance of showers in the morning, then

