.SYNOPSIS...A weak low pressure center over the waters today will

drift W of the waters tonight. Additionally a trough along the

California coast will persist tonight through Fri night. The

coastal trough will slowly begin dissipate as strong cold front

will approach the N waters late Sat into Sat night. 



