Marine Weather Statement

National Weather Service Gaylord MI

706 PM EDT Mon Aug 11 2025



LSZ322-112345-

706 PM EDT Mon Aug 11 2025



A Marine Weather Statement has been issued for the following areas...

  St Marys River...



At 705 PM EDT, Doppler radar indicated a shower, capable of producing

winds to around 30 knots. This shower was located just south of Sault

Sainte Marie, moving east at 20 knots.



The shower will be near...

  Sugar Island around 720 PM EDT.



PRECAUTIONARY/PREPAREDNESS ACTIONS...



Mariners can expect gusty winds to around 30 knots, locally higher

waves, and lightning strikes. Boaters should seek safe harbor

immediately until this storm passes.



