Flagstaff Aviation Discussion

Issued at 2146 UTC Monday, August 11, 2025



.AVIATION...Monday 11/18Z through Tuesday 12/18Z...VFR conditions. 

Isolated -SHRA/-TSRA from 19Z-02Z, mainly along and south of a

KFLG - KSOW line. Gusty outflow winds possible in and around 

showers/storms. Daytime winds W/NW 10-15 kts gusting to 25 kts, 

becoming VRB 5-10 kts overnight.

OUTLOOK...Tuesday 12/18Z through Thursday 14/18Z...VFR conditions. 

Isolated -SHRA/-TSRA again Tuesday along and south of a KFLG -

KSOW line. TS coverage will increase to scattered on Wednesday for

areas south/west of a KGCN - KSOW line. Gusty outflow winds 

possible in and around TS. Daytime winds will be W to NW 10-15 

kts each day, becoming less than 10 kts overnight.





