       C..............CHANCE

       L..............LIKELY

       WD.............WIDESPREAD

       D..............DEFINITE

       AR.............AREAS

       PA.............PATCHY

OBVIS...............................OBSTRUCTION TO VISIBILITY

     F.......FOG

     PF......PATCHY FOG

     F+......DENSE FOG

