Terminals KABR,KATY,KPIR,KMBG



Mainly MVFR conditions are expected over the next 24 hours. The

main exception will be for thunderstorms possible this evening at

ATY, and to a lesser extent at ABR. Given the weakening trend of

upstream convection, showers were only mentioned at ABR.



