.TUESDAY...PARTLY CLOUDY. A SLIGHT CHANCE OF SHOWERS AND

THUNDERSTORMS BEFORE 10 AM, THEN A CHANCE OF SHOWERS AND

THUNDERSTORMS BETWEEN 10 AM AND 6 PM. SHOWERS AND THUNDERSTORMS

LIKELY AFTER 6 PM. HIGHS IN THE UPPER 80S. TEMPERATURE FALLING

INTO THE IN THE LOWER 80S IN THE AFTERNOON. SOUTHWEST WINDS 10 TO

15 MPH. RAINFALL AMOUNTS BETWEEN A QUARTER INCH AND A HALF INCH.

CHANCE OF RAIN 70 PERCENT. 

.TUESDAY NIGHT...MOSTLY CLOUDY THROUGH MIDNIGHT, THEN BECOMING

PARTLY CLOUDY. SHOWERS LIKELY AND A CHANCE OF THUNDERSTORMS

THROUGH MIDNIGHT, THEN A CHANCE OF SHOWERS AND A SLIGHT CHANCE OF

THUNDERSTORMS BETWEEN MIDNIGHT AND 2 AM. A SLIGHT CHANCE OF

SHOWERS AFTER 2 AM. LOWS IN THE UPPER 60S. SOUTHWEST WINDS AROUND

5 MPH. RAINFALL AMOUNTS BETWEEN A QUARTER INCH AND A HALF INCH.

CHANCE OF RAIN 60 PERCENT. 

.WEDNESDAY...PARTLY CLOUDY IN THE MORNING THEN CLEARING. A SLIGHT

CHANCE OF SHOWERS. A SLIGHT CHANCE OF THUNDERSTORMS AFTER 2 PM.

HIGHS IN THE LOWER 80S. TEMPERATURE FALLING INTO THE IN THE UPPER

70S IN THE AFTERNOON. NORTHWEST WINDS 5 TO 10 MPH. CHANCE OF RAIN

20 PERCENT. 

.WEDNESDAY NIGHT...COOLER, CLEAR. LOWS IN THE UPPER 50S.

NORTHWEST WINDS AROUND 5 MPH THROUGH 2 AM, BECOMING LIGHT AND

VARIABLE. 

.THURSDAY...SUNNY. HIGHS IN THE LOWER 80S. 

.THURSDAY NIGHT...CLEAR. LOWS IN THE LOWER 60S. 

.FRIDAY...SUNNY. HIGHS IN THE UPPER 80S. 

.FRIDAY NIGHT...MOSTLY CLEAR. LOWS IN THE UPPER 60S. 

.SATURDAY...MOSTLY SUNNY. HOT WITH HIGHS IN THE LOWER 90S. HEAT

INDEX VALUES IN THE UPPER 90S. 

.SATURDAY NIGHT...MOSTLY CLEAR. A SLIGHT CHANCE OF SHOWERS AFTER

2 AM. LOWS IN THE LOWER 70S. CHANCE OF RAIN 20 PERCENT. 

.SUNDAY...MOSTLY SUNNY WITH A SLIGHT CHANCE OF SHOWERS AND

THUNDERSTORMS THROUGH 2 PM, THEN PARTLY CLOUDY WITH A CHANCE OF

SHOWERS AND THUNDERSTORMS AFTER 2 PM. HIGHS IN THE UPPER 80S.

CHANCE OF RAIN 30 PERCENT. HEAT INDEX VALUES IN THE MID 90S. 

.SUNDAY NIGHT...A SLIGHT CHANCE OF THUNDERSTORMS THROUGH 2 AM.

PARTLY CLOUDY WITH A SLIGHT CHANCE OF SHOWERS. LOWS IN THE MID

60S. CHANCE OF RAIN 20 PERCENT. 

.MONDAY...PARTLY CLOUDY. A SLIGHT CHANCE OF SHOWERS THROUGH 2 PM,

THEN A CHANCE OF SHOWERS WITH A SLIGHT CHANCE OF THUNDERSTORMS

AFTER 2 PM. HIGHS IN THE MID 80S. TEMPERATURE FALLING TO AROUND

80 IN THE AFTERNOON. CHANCE OF RAIN 30 PERCENT. 



