...HEAT ADVISORY IN EFFECT FROM 11 AM TO 8 PM PDT TUESDAY...



.DISCUSSION...Daytime high temperatures will be around five 

degrees warmer than normal Tuesday. Otherwise occasional 

afternoon wind gusts between 20 and 25 mph expected. Slightly 

better instability Tuesday afternoon produces cumulus buildups,

though thunderstorms are not expected. Overnight winds remain

downvalley/downslope dominant. 



.TONIGHT...



Sky/weather.........Mostly clear (5-15 percent). 

Min temperature.....Around 61. 

Max humidity........29 percent. 

