 Slope/valley.......Southwest winds 5 to 7 mph shifting to the west 

                    8 to 12 mph in the afternoon. 

CWR.................0 percent. 

Mixing height.......9100 ft AGL increasing to 10400 ft AGL late in 

                    the afternoon. 

Transport winds.....Southwest around 10 mph. 



.TUESDAY NIGHT...



