afternoon/evening showers. Otherwise, no changes made to current

forecast, everything is on track. 



&&



.AVIATION...

(00Z TAFS)

Issued at 722 PM EDT Mon Aug 11 2025



Most shower and storm activity has moved away from terminals,

however a few isolated pop up showers or storms could still be

possible for the next couple of hours. VFR conditions prevail

overnight and through the morning. Afternoon thunderstorms develop

tomorrow afternoon/evening and could move into the vicinity of 

terminals. 



