FNAK51 PAFC 112345

FWFAER



FIRE WEATHER PLANNING FORECAST FOR SOUTHCENTRAL ALASKA

NATIONAL WEATHER SERVICE ANCHORAGE AK

345 PM AKDT Mon Aug 11 2025



.DISCUSSION...



Precipitation is diminishing this afternoon as high pressure builds 

in from the west resulting in drier conditions. The Copper River 

Basin will see relative humidity values will decrease into the 40 

percent range Monday and into the 30s on Tuesday. Southcentral to 

return to an increasingly wet pattern by midweek. 



