...Hot Temperatures and Low Relative Humidity this evening...



.DISCUSSION...

Hot temperatures and low daytime humidity with poor overnight 

recoveries continue this evening. Periodically breezy winds will 

remain diurnally driven, with southwest gusts to 15 mph at 

times in the afternoon and early evening tapering off to lighter 

northeast winds overnight. A cooling trend with gradually 

improving humidity is expected from Tuesday onward.



.REST OF TODAY...



